        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B60 Deadbolt Screws and Driver Bar</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStandard replacement screws and driver bar (Tail Piece) for Schlage B60 single cylinder deadbolts. Available in 9 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n For use with <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Schlage B60 Deadbolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/camelot-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60cam\"><b>Schlage B60 Camelot Deadbolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/brookshire-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60brk\"><b>Schlage B60 Brookshire Deadbolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/wakefield-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60wkf\"><b>Schlage B60 Wakefield Deadbolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/addison-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60add\"><b>Schlage B60 Addison Deadbolts</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/century-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60cen\"><b>Schlage B60 Century Deadbolts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage 61-071 Parts Kit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Screws: (2) each 1/4\"-28 x 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Driver Bar Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: For 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
